{
    "title": "Classic Solitaire 2024",
    "description": "[Classic Solitaire 2024] is about to subvert your understanding of the classic solitaire card game and bring you an unparalleled adventure !\r\n\r\n1. Friendly interface: The large cards and large text allow you to immerse yourself in the joy of Solitaire. The simple and clear interface makes it easy for you to get started.\r\n\r\n2. Intelligent adjustment of difficulty: Whether you are a novice or a master, you can experience the fun that is unique to you in the game. It can not only exercise your brain easily, but also take you on a thrilling journey.\r\n\r\n3. Diversified themes: quiet and comfortable forests; green mountains covered with snow; smart and cute animals; and a sky full of glow, which can be switched at will, making you feel like you are in a diverse space, making you linger and forget to leave.\r\n\r\n4.Innovative gameplay: Multiple gameplay modes challenge your wisdom from multiple dimensions. We look forward to you unlocking incredible new gameplays.",
    "descriptionHTML": "[Classic Solitaire 2024] is about to subvert your understanding of the classic solitaire card game and bring you an unparalleled adventure !<br><br>1. Friendly interface: The large cards and large text allow you to immerse yourself in the joy of Solitaire. The simple and clear interface makes it easy for you to get started.<br><br>2. Intelligent adjustment of difficulty: Whether you are a novice or a master, you can experience the fun that is unique to you in the game. It can not only exercise your brain easily, but also take you on a thrilling journey.<br><br>3. Diversified themes: quiet and comfortable forests; green mountains covered with snow; smart and cute animals; and a sky full of glow, which can be switched at will, making you feel like you are in a diverse space, making you linger and forget to leave.<br><br>4.Innovative gameplay: Multiple gameplay modes challenge your wisdom from multiple dimensions. We look forward to you unlocking incredible new gameplays.",
